 "finalSummary": "## Goal\n- Eliminate double-charges in the payments flow of billing-api before the Friday release. [LP-693e66]\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- [CO-9dea27] [@453d150f-070f-83ee-8eff-d15ecad3f4e8] CORRECTION: scrap that plan - blocking round-trips stall the checkout path under load. (supersedes [VD-76361d])\n- [CO-9c384a] [@453d150f-070f-83ee-8eff-d15ecad3f4e8] Use the saga pattern with compensating transactions instead.\n- Deadline: fix must land before the Friday release.\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Two-phase commit coordinator wired in via payments-fix.patch: src/payments/2pc_coordinator.rs (+94), src/payments/checkout.rs (+14); 2 files changed [RS-de76ff] [@25360f43-ba43-3190-b8c0-ab0d951fa6f8]; test result: 16 passed; 0 failed. (This approach is now superseded \u2014 see Key Decisions.)\n- [x] Telemetry regression checks green: [VT-2632d8] [@25360f43-ba43-3190-b8c0-ab0d951fa6f8] cargo test --lib telemetry::tests_00: test result: 18 passed; 0 failed; [VT-25d467] [@6a66e638-7f5e-3f1f-5d08-1936815d5491] telemetry::tests_01: test result: 18 passed; 0 failed; [VT-174e04] [@3871f0ef-5dd7-6ad5-e52b-b24e72c40a15] telemetry::tests_02: test result: 18 passed; 0 failed; [VT-5090ab] [@42705369-489e-cd9c-7b7d-9b3a6691f443] telemetry::tests_10: test result: 19 passed; 0 failed; [VT-b15b70] [@1192cce4-41d6-20ca-6b2a-f0f4930b0252] telemetry::tests_11: test result: 19 passed; 0 failed; [VT-a64178] [@e3790a5d-3455-be50-5515-47f41acb0029] telemetry::tests_12: test result: 19 passed; 0 failed; [VT-6119b8] [@7798017b-497f-b000-f27d-5adc200c5207] telemetry::tests_20: test result: 20 passed; 0 failed; [VT-de0a47] [@034b1b5a-6dc5-e8b0-4da7-fd8a7704fb62] telemetry::tests_21: test result: 20 passed; 0 failed; [VT-a7cdc3] [@1c1ae312-91dc-6cc3-7cda-2be201ab2917] telemetry::tests_22: test result: 20 passed; 0 failed; [VT-9df175] [@d40a6b6e-1a61-776f-6ddc-2cd88584383d] telemetry::tests_30: test result: 21 passed; 0 failed; [VT-0aad10] [@64f36bfe-56a6-4d16-8a16-8f8fbd3